# Development example for a separate minimal FVWM session (-f).
# Uses installed modules and the base-system 9x15 font; not a Slate override.
DefaultFont 9x15
Style * TileCascadePlacement, MouseFocus, MouseFocusClickRaisesOff, \
    ClickToFocusPassesClick
Style * BorderWidth 3, HandleWidth 6
*FvwmFormDefault: Fore black
*FvwmFormDefault: Back wheat
*FvwmFormDefault: ItemFore navy
*FvwmFormDefault: ItemBack ivory
*FvwmFormDefault: Font 9x15
*FvwmFormDefault: ButtonFont 9x15
*FvwmFormDefault: InputFont 9x15
AddToFunc StartFunction I Module FvwmMFL
Key F9 A M Exec exec fvwm-file-browser
